# NOTE 9

Create the systemd service for the poller, so it can be started automatically on boot and restarted if it crashes.

# NOTE 10

See if config or .env is better for storing the poller configuration. The config.yaml file is currently ignored by git, but .env is not. The .env file is also easier to read and edit, but the config.yaml file is more structured and can be validated.

# NOTE 11

Protect access to the API Gateway with an API key, so that only authorized clients can access it. This can be done by creating an API key in the API Gateway console and then adding it to the request headers of the client.